  "releaseNotes": "v5.0.0 (2026-09-30)\n      - Dependency update: Portamical.Core.Formatting to v3.0.0 (breaking change: DefaultFormatter is now internal; use Formatter.Format(...) / Formatter.GetFormatter(...)).\n      - New: INamedCase.HasName(string?) for ordinal test case name matching.\n      - New: Validator.NotNullOrEmpty(IEnumerable<T>?, string?, out int count) overload avoiding redundant Length re-evaluation.\n      - New: Resolver.SnapshotOrNull(IEnumerable<T>?) snapshot helper preventing multiple enumeration.",
